<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 7.5 bln SKR worth of T-bill.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 7.5 bln SKR worth of T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of 7.5 billion crowns worth of Treasury bills.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on June 25, it said and bids are due at 1030 GMT that day. Settlement date is June 27.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE		ISSUE VOLUME	    NUMBER OF DAYS</p>
<p> Sept 17, 1997		 500 million SKR		   80</p>
<p> June 17, 1998		 7.0 bln SKR		  350</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-101</p>
